The components in this folder, the layout components in ../layout and the Tailwind theme are adapted from
Camera_Trap (https://github.com/cameaci/Camera_Trap, commit 176451c), which is distributed under the MIT
License below. Camera_Trap's own primitives follow shadcn/ui (MIT). Adapted at the project owner's request
on 2026-10-22; changes: native <dialog>, <select> and checkbox elements instead of Radix primitives (to keep
the strict style-src Content Security Policy), a neutral colour token and Bat Innovation layouts.

